  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At Wu Du Xiu’s funeral, third supreme elder Wu Qiao holds this Immortal Gu to certify Wu Yi Hai’s identity. He tells the gathered Gu Immortals that Wu clan obtained it by killing a blood path demonic immortal, calling it a trophy of victory. Those present treat blood path as not tolerated and too dangerous, while every righteous path force secretly researches it because it can raise battle strength the quickest. This Immortal Gu was the product of Wu clan’s research, and they called it their loot from battle.",
        "chapters": [
          1220
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_wu_du_xiu",
          "char_wu_qiao",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_wu_yi_hai",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "fac_wu_clan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Wu Qiao asks for a drop of blood and aims the Immortal Gu at it. A dark red light shines, and there are no issues. Fang Yuan, using Wu Yi Hai’s identity, had restored blood asset Immortal Gu and added it into familiar face to disguise his bloodline, which is how he passes this test. He notes that a rank eight version might not have been deceivable, and that Wu clan would not spend the cost of raising a blood path Immortal Gu to rank eight. Wu Qiao then says they would also have inspected soul and bones if Wu Du Xiu were alive. After questions and this Gu test, Fang Yuan refines life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu for Wu clan’s ancestral hall as the mark of acknowledgement into the clan.",
        "chapters": [
          1220
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_blood_asset_immortal_gu",
          "gu_soul_lantern_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan asks Wu clan for bloodline Immortal Gu, saying he needs it in the super Gu formation to raise its power.",
        "chapters": [
          1369
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loan-request",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_super_gu_formation"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Wu Yong decides to lend it, and Fang Yuan borrows six Immortal Gu from Wu clan in all.",
        "chapters": [
          1370
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loan-request",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_wu_yong"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With Wu Yi Hai missing, Wu Yong has to give chase, chiefly because Fang Yuan borrowed six Wu clan Immortal Gu, this one among them on Wu Yong’s personal approval.",
        "chapters": [
          1378
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loan-request",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "With a wisdom path Immortal Gu from Purple Mountain True Monarch’s inheritance, it is one of the two core Immortal Gu of the Blood Red Immortal Essence Formation.",
        "chapters": [
          1427
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "loan-request",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch",
          "sys_immortal_essence"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
